  "mcpNotes": {
    "sentry": "Removed 2026-02-09 - Add back when deploying production apps: https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp",
    "filesystem": "Removed 2026-02-09 - Built-in Read/Write/Glob/Grep cover file ops, saved ~2-3K tokens",
    "memory": "Removed 2026-02-09. Replaced by cmem, then agentmemory; agentmemory removed 2026-08-05 (LLM summarize never configured — 3,609 calls, 0 successes, 1 memory stored, so capture never became recall). Session memory now via memory-persistence hooks + Nexus.",
